{"title":"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all real solutions of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/9/e09fa3201e95a3fb9793da496b54e7768384df3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x^2 \\rfloor + \\lceil x^2 \\rceil = 2003$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>[Note: For any real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/c/6cc5df17e994985d836b136eced5b19db7e7294d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor \\alpha \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" /> is the largest integer less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302ca29db609b01547a4aef655449ec6a8f12ba4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lceil \\alpha \\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" /> denote the smallest integer more than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />.]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are two cases to consider -- one where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is positive and one where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is negative.\n</p><p><br />\nFor the positive case, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/c/fbc46233c3975512dabeb5144249445ca2ef086b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\sqrt{a},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> then the equation results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70fe07d9b72e487c7990ddf14b7dc2c99e0c8c59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 2003.$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" />  Since the equation does not have an integral solution, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec1ff0cc8fa53cc08fad59786097f6c729ef3ea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ne \\sqrt{a}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"19\" />  If we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/407c11989c454353184904fe73c7c5c88846eaf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a} &lt; x &lt; \\sqrt{a+1}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" />  That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/4/dd41867baa6201a3b3bedd0d4eb3eeb78c9890f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + a + 1 = 2003,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" /> and solving the equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/d/37ddbffbec81eb436442bb4eb63cea066668dcb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1001.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />  For confirmation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/c/10cc46916b15d3c4920fdd37c52a41bee4bfb778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001 \\le \\lfloor x^2 \\rfloor &lt; 1002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/3/043a8f93156feee69d18b2c11cb2463c7e6474a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001 &lt; \\lceil x^2 \\rceil \\le 1002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29f6e49708329c54855ffa57ed118e122fd7d78d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2002 &lt; \\lfloor x^2 \\rfloor + \\lceil x^2 \\rceil &lt; 2004$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"211\" height=\"20\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d007955e11905d66201706ad4dca61efbd3ec0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x^2 \\rfloor + \\lceil x^2 \\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" /> can only have integral values, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/9/e09fa3201e95a3fb9793da496b54e7768384df3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x^2 \\rfloor + \\lceil x^2 \\rceil = 2003$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nFor the negative case, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/8057f1a2098f080eca7ff15f2b6ab455e28a4204.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -\\sqrt{a},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> then the equation results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70fe07d9b72e487c7990ddf14b7dc2c99e0c8c59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 2003.$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" />  This also does not have an integral solution, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec1ff0cc8fa53cc08fad59786097f6c729ef3ea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ne \\sqrt{a}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"19\" />  If we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/c/94c33bcc8f1f6ffe300529a11a3a343a54085f9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\sqrt{a+1} &lt; x &lt; -\\sqrt{a}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"171\" height=\"19\" />  That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/3/163b66db7ff33be262d6a976ed726de40a0cff0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+1 + a = 2003,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" /> and this equation also yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/d/37ddbffbec81eb436442bb4eb63cea066668dcb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1001.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />  For confirmation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/e/06ed304d2ed6060ee522a1a5b9938dd5e3171986.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001 &lt; \\lfloor x^2 \\rfloor \\le 1002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96e85b621eb4a396a57fb6e450b82fa0d083ecc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001 \\le \\lceil x^2 \\rceil &lt; 1002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29f6e49708329c54855ffa57ed118e122fd7d78d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2002 &lt; \\lfloor x^2 \\rfloor + \\lceil x^2 \\rceil &lt; 2004$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"211\" height=\"20\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d007955e11905d66201706ad4dca61efbd3ec0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x^2 \\rfloor + \\lceil x^2 \\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" /> can only have integral values, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/9/e09fa3201e95a3fb9793da496b54e7768384df3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x^2 \\rfloor + \\lceil x^2 \\rceil = 2003$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nIn interval notation, the solutions of the equation are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/6604a7991cd71cff8814d45d7ff1c334ac43b8a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(-\\sqrt{1002}, -\\sqrt{1001}) \\cup (\\sqrt{1001}, \\sqrt{1002})}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"314\" height=\"33\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO\">2003 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202514\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 193/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6033/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.629      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    6.629      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16625:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202514 and revision id 119625. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}